{"3751070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rail Gunner", "steam_appid": 3751070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3771940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sci-fi rail shooter for PC, PCVR and Mac</strong>  (<i>also available free on iOS &amp; Android</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your train against waves of AI-controlled robots that run, fly, rocket and roll in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully destructible enemies</strong> – Voxels + physical simulation makes for infinite variation in the carnage you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neural-network AI</strong> – Damaged bots limp, crawl or skid to keep the hunt alive.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> - Rail guns, plasma weapons, lasers, missiles and a variety of powerups to fuel the destruction.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR</strong> - Immerse yourself in the chase. Unique integrated zooming allows you to make that distant sharp shot while keeping a gunsight on the enemies at your heels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong>   <br> • <i>Chase</i> – survive endless pursuit, holding out for the next supply carriage while pushing for the highest score.   <br> • <i>Node Assault</i> – fight through the defenders and destroy the enemy brain-train to continue your progress towards new weapons and powerups. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player only. Play the core endless gameplay loop for free. One optional DLC unlocks complete progression, allowing all weapons and power-ups to be earned through play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sci-fi rail shooter for PC, PCVR and Mac</strong>  (<i>also available free on iOS &amp; Android</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your train against waves of AI-controlled robots that run, fly, rocket and roll in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully destructible enemies</strong> – Voxels + physical simulation makes for infinite variation in the carnage you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/c6aeb5e9a355335701d49852f9613103.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neural-network AI</strong> – Damaged bots limp, crawl or skid to keep the hunt alive.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/dad04c4fb2c28364788ab2a388a894b7.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> - Rail guns, plasma weapons, lasers, missiles and a variety of powerups to fuel the destruction.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/0cad0198fd3dac9642ce80a3c1277936.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR</strong> - Immerse yourself in the chase. Unique integrated zooming allows you to make that distant sharp shot while keeping a gunsight on the enemies at your heels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.poster.avif?t=1761340934\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.webm?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/extras/97bd8c5c0be837c159a08876191031ab.mp4?t=1761340934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong>   <br> • <i>Chase</i> – survive endless pursuit, holding out for the next supply carriage while pushing for the highest score.   <br> • <i>Node Assault</i> – fight through the defenders and destroy the enemy brain-train to continue your progress towards new weapons and powerups. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player only. Play the core endless gameplay loop for free. One optional DLC unlocks complete progression, allowing all weapons and power-ups to be earned through play.</p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi rail shooter for PC, PCVR and Mac. Defend your train against AI controlled robots which run, fly, rocket and roll in pursuit. Enemies are fully destructible and physically simulated. A variety of weapons and power-ups to unlock.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/a1a7d1be00f9fdc7ff711e326ad1af91e107ab47/header.jpg?t=1761340934", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/b40c60eaf4728fad70a6944a47e8f9871a528d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761340934", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751070/b40c60eaf4728fad70a6944a47e8f9871a528d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761340934", "website": "https://runswimfly.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<s